From: View <dev@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] fix: fit stable screen calibration and persist complete state

Fit an affine map on CPU from raw, distinct camera predictions without changing
network weights afterward. Store the map in the same TF.js artifact as the
model. Reject incomplete restored state, serialize worker commands, and scope
camera teardown to its owning stream.

